{"unit_id":"imaused__dsh-kb-lite#card-zh","repo":"imaused/dsh-kb-lite","commit":"36a90f3f3c940c7a39bf156627732fb80059d2fe","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-kb-lite 是 DeepSeek Harness 的本地知识库插件，在 Host 侧注册工具，读取 Markdown、纯文本和 PDF 文件并建立本机索引。它提供文件摄取、BM25 搜索、可选的本地向量或混合检索、原文证据问答、索引统计和按变更同步。搜索结果附带文件路径、标题、行号或页码，方便核对来源。适合希望让 DSH 检索个人文档、记忆文件或项目资料的用户。基础 BM25 无需额外服务或密钥；需要 Node.js 18+ 与 Python 3.9+，PDF 和向量检索可选安装对应 Python 库。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-7","lib/plugin.js:599-603","engine/kb_engine.py:1617-1632"]}
{"unit_id":"imaused__dsh-kb-lite#card-en","repo":"imaused/dsh-kb-lite","commit":"36a90f3f3c940c7a39bf156627732fb80059d2fe","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-kb-lite adds host tools to index local Markdown, text, and PDF files for DeepSeek Harness. It offers BM25 search, optional dense or hybrid retrieval, quoted evidence, index statistics, and incremental sync. Basic BM25 needs no API key; Node.js 18+ and Python 3.9+ are required.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:6-7","lib/plugin.js:599-603","engine/kb_engine.py:1617-1632"]}
